WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.767
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:04.667
Thank you for watching.
I appreciate it.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:07.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:10.000
Well, guys, former president
Trump is in the news.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.367
Apparently he's been trashing
Florida governor Ron DeSantis

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:17.000
behind his back, calling him
a dull guy who has no chance of

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.534
beating him in a potential
2024 matchup.

00:00:19.534 --> 00:00:21.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.968
Trump was like, "I have to
insult him behind his back

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:26.167
'cause I can't tweet it
to his face."

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:29.467
I feel like Trump is slipping.

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:31.200
A few years ago he would have
had like 10 nicknames

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.400
for this guy by now.
It's like, "Ron Dull-Santis."

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.033
I think the insults backfired
'cause just hearing Trump's name

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:42.000
jump-started Biden's approval
rating back up in the 50s.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.534
[ Laughter ]
It's in the 50s now. Yeah.

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:46.400
I think this is
actually a nice change

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.367
'cause usually when two Florida
guys get into a fight,

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:49.701
they're drunk and shirtless.

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:51.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.234 --> 00:00:53.467
But DeSantis doesn't seem fazed.

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:55.133
He said that he's going to
handle the insult

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:57.100
just like COVID
and completely ignore it.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:00.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:02.801
And speaking of
the former president,

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:05.567
this weekend he held
his first rally of the year.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.734
Let's take a listen to
what he had to say.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:10.968
-The grocery shelves, the
department store shelves,

00:01:10.968 --> 00:01:12.634
they're empty.

00:01:12.634 --> 00:01:15.100
You had an excuse not to buy
Christmas gifts.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.000
You say to your loved one,
"Darling, I'm sorry.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.367
I love you very much,
but I just can't.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:21.868
There's no merchandise
in Tiffany.

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:24.033
I wanted to buy you
the most beautiful ring,

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:25.801
but they don't have any rings
anymore.

00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:27.801
Nobody has anything."

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:30.534
We never even heard the term
"supply change."

00:01:30.534 --> 00:01:35.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.634
-Supply change.

00:01:37.634 --> 00:01:40.000
Well, a year off,
and he's still got it.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.934
I think he's still got it.
I think...

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:45.901
[ Cheers and applause ]
I think he's still got it.

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:48.868
He's right. He's right.
He's right.

00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:50.868
We've never heard the term
"supply change."

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:52.868
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.868 --> 00:01:54.701
-And then he started talking
about things

00:01:54.701 --> 00:01:56.501
being expensive
'cause of inflammation.

00:01:56.501 --> 00:02:00.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:03.734
Trump knows exactly what
concerns working families --

00:02:03.734 --> 00:02:05.601
the ring inventory at Tiffany's.

00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:09.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:11.667
Well, guys, as if we're not
dealing with enough right now,

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:14.934
doctors are warning people
against a new TikTok trend

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:18.000
called "sleepy chicken,"

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.601
where people cook chicken
in NyQuil.

00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:21.767
-No!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:23.601
-Yes.
-No.

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:26.534
-Yeah.
-What?

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:27.901
-There's actually another name

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:29.200
for chicken
that makes you sleepy.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:30.367
It's called turkey.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.367 --> 00:02:33.267
Just eat turkey.

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:35.033
That's right.
Doctors are warning people

00:02:35.033 --> 00:02:37.434
against cooking chicken
in cold medicine.

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:39.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.167
I mean, the recipe is wild.
Take a look at this recipe.

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:44.567
It says add oil to pan
then add chicken.

00:02:44.567 --> 00:02:46.901
Then sauté in bottle of NyQuil.

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:48.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:49.834
After that,
cook chicken through,

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:53.234
transfer to plate,
and then enjoy.

00:02:53.234 --> 00:02:55.801
After that, wake up facedown
in plate four hours later.

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:57.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.133 --> 00:02:59.000
Next, stumble into garage,

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.534
drive car straight through
garage door.

00:03:01.534 --> 00:03:04.534
Then drive to Taco Bell
on wrong side of road

00:03:04.534 --> 00:03:06.434
going three miles per hour.

00:03:06.434 --> 00:03:11.000
After that, remove shirt, demand
eggplant parm and a Twinkie.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.467
Then get arrested.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:16.234
Next, use one phone call on
the only number you remember --

00:03:16.234 --> 00:03:17.501
the house you grew up
in as a kid.

00:03:17.501 --> 00:03:18.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.868 --> 00:03:23.200
Then spend night in jail,
join gang for protection.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.033
After that, get neck tattoo of
prison nickname --

00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:27.234
"Sizzurp Chicken."

00:03:27.234 --> 00:03:33.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:33.067 --> 00:03:37.434
Then gain freedom but lose job
as high school principal.

00:03:37.434 --> 00:03:39.701
And finally,
refrigerate leftovers.

00:03:39.701 --> 00:03:42.000
So, I mean,
it's a tricky recipe.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.801
Just stay away from it.
[ Applause ]

00:03:44.801 --> 00:03:46.367
Hey, did you guys see this?

00:03:46.367 --> 00:03:49.400
A Norwegian cruise ship canceled
its trip

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.501
mid-voyage due to COVID.

00:03:51.501 --> 00:03:52.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.701 --> 00:03:56.133
And now a bunch of passengers
are stuck at sea.

00:03:56.133 --> 00:03:58.667
Norwegian told the passengers,
"There's no reason to panic.

00:03:58.667 --> 00:04:00.467
There's plenty of NyQuil chicken
for everyone."

00:04:00.467 --> 00:04:02.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:04.234
Passengers are furious.

00:04:04.234 --> 00:04:05.701
They're like,
"When I booked this cruise

00:04:05.701 --> 00:04:07.801
during a COVID surge,
who knew this could happen?"

00:04:07.801 --> 00:04:12.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.033 --> 00:04:14.133
Everyone's just stranded
and angry.

00:04:14.133 --> 00:04:15.200
That's got to be
a lot of pressure

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.734
for the cruise ship comic.

00:04:16.734 --> 00:04:19.501
"So, where are you folks
being held from?"

00:04:19.501 --> 00:04:22.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.734
I saw that over the weekend
on the Saturday edition

00:04:24.734 --> 00:04:27.434
of the "Today" show,
one meteorologist had a cough

00:04:27.434 --> 00:04:30.434
coming on, and she did her best
to fight through it.

00:04:30.434 --> 00:04:31.934
Just watch this.

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:34.734
-Well, our friends out west have
lucked out with dry conditions

00:04:34.734 --> 00:04:36.634
and mild conditions out towards
the Rockies.

00:04:36.634 --> 00:04:39.400
And, of course, we're seeing...
that winter storm

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.868
that's going to impact
the East Coast.

00:04:40.868 --> 00:04:44.200
[ Coughs ]
Excuse me.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.767
Let's go ahead and take a look
at your...forecast.

00:04:46.767 --> 00:04:49.634
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.634 --> 00:04:51.033
-Somara getting
a little bit of water,

00:04:51.033 --> 00:04:53.133
and she will be back with
more in just a bit.

00:04:53.133 --> 00:04:54.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.467 --> 00:04:55.501
-Oh, my gosh.

00:04:55.501 --> 00:04:58.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.033 --> 00:05:00.100
-Oh, poor thing.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:02.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:02.667 --> 00:05:05.067
-She sounds like the captain of
a Norwegian cruise.

00:05:05.067 --> 00:05:06.934
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.934 --> 00:05:10.200
At first it looked like she was
just overcome with the emotion

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.901
at the sight of a cold front.

00:05:11.901 --> 00:05:15.968
And then "I -- I promised myself
I wouldn't do this."

00:05:15.968 --> 00:05:18.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:20.000
Could we just watch that again
just 'cause it's funny?

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:23.801
-Of course, we're seeing...
that winter storm

00:05:23.801 --> 00:05:25.367
that's going to impact
the East Coast.

00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:28.367
[ Coughs ]
Excuse me.

00:05:28.367 --> 00:05:30.868
Let's go ahead and take a look
at your...forecast.

00:05:30.868 --> 00:05:39.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.968 --> 00:05:43.067
-Some business news --
I saw that once again

00:05:43.067 --> 00:05:46.033
Netflix increased its monthly
subscription prices.

00:05:46.033 --> 00:05:49.567
[ Audience booing ]

00:05:49.567 --> 00:05:52.501
Apparently Netflix's plan is
to take so much of our money

00:05:52.501 --> 00:05:54.701
that we'll have to enter
a real-life squid game.

00:05:54.701 --> 00:05:56.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.400
Netflix says that you can
either pay the increase

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.667
or enjoy not knowing
what anyone's talking about

00:06:00.667 --> 00:06:01.834
for the next 70 years.

00:06:01.834 --> 00:06:03.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.167 --> 00:06:04.968
And finally, I heard that
there's a new push here

00:06:04.968 --> 00:06:08.000
in New York City to put
trash containers on the streets

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.300
so that there aren't
giant mountains

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.100
of trash bags on the sidewalks.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.467
It's like a developer came
in and said, "I got it --

00:06:14.467 --> 00:06:15.701
rat condominiums."

00:06:15.701 --> 00:06:18.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.033 --> 00:06:19.467
It should be great.

00:06:19.467 --> 00:06:21.801
This way, instead of having to
look at ugly piles of trash,

00:06:21.801 --> 00:06:23.801
we'll get to see all
these beautiful dumpsters.

